## Design direction

A compact souvenir and promotional format available in zinc alloy, soft PVC or tinplate, paired with a metal magnet or magnetic-rubber backing.

For custom fridge magnets, begin with the part of the artwork that must read first. Keep the outline, smallest lettering, color breaks and functional details clear, then use finish and presentation to support the design rather than compete with it.

## Confirmed choices and project decisions

- Materials include zinc alloy, soft PVC, and tinplate; backings include a metal magnet or magnetic rubber.

## Preparing your brief

Send the artwork, intended dimensions, quantity, delivery destination and required timing. Note which surfaces, moving parts, attachments or packaging details matter most so the quotation can be based on one clear specification.

Golden One will use the approved brief as the basis for the final product specification; unconfirmed materials, claims and performance details are not assumed.
